<a id="schema"></a>

## Schema

The config's form, as a JSON Schema, [`schema/fsm.json`]({{ root }}/payload/lib/dsys/schema/fsm.json),
and every `@{{ name }}` body is checked against it as the makefile is read. An scxml body
skips this check, since the [converter](#scxml) writes the config, and the normalizer
refuses what it does not lower.

